==Description==
The '''Aurora Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 21 of the premium [[Operation I.C.E Event#Operation I.C.E Event Battle Pass|Operation I.C.E Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{Bell|670}} or {{Robux|72}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Bell|6,760}} or {{Robux|1,817}}.

The '''Aurora Nametag''' has pink to blue to pink gradient text with a translucent blue outline. There is a large aurora borealis behind the nametag.

==Trivia==
*The description for this nametag is a reference to [[w:c:simpsons:Steamed Hams|Steamed Hams]], a short featured in the ''Simpsons''.
*This [[Nametags|nametag]] is the biggest nametag in the game, covering the whole player.

